; Room 6 ($06): Entrance to Hades
;
; Format: see #R$C000.
; .
; Border: red (2). Conveyor: none. Ramp: none.
; .
; Items: none in the item table.
; .
; Exits: left Room 14 (Rescue Esmerelda, #R$CE00); right Room 5 (The Security
; Guard, #R$C500); up Room 0 (The Off Licence, #R$C000); down Room 0 (The Off
; Licence, #R$C000). Odd: the right exit of Room 14 is Room 44, not this room;
; the left exit of Room 5 is Room 19, not this room; the left edge of the
; layout is walled in (no free cell next to it), so the left exit (byte 14)
; cannot be used by walking (inferred from the layout).
; .
; Entities: slot 0: definition $10 (at $A080) start $82; slot 1: definition
; $11 (at $A088) start $A4; slot 2: definition $12 (at $A090) start $C3. List
; ends at slot 3 ($FF).
@label=RoomEntranceToHades
